BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 590.4 Td (An uncertain owner or unresolved journal blocks competing execution. Do not steal a lock based) Tj ET
BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 577.0 Td (  on age or PID guesses, reconstruct a consumed one-shot capability after a crash, or label an) Tj ET
BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 563.7 Td (  ambiguous launch as an ordinary verifier failure. Resolve through the existing lifecycle and) Tj ET
BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 550.3 Td (  recovery state. Recovery of the same exact identity may continue; replan to a new identity) Tj ET
BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 537.0 Td (  cannot inherit old completion evidence.) Tj ET
BT /F3 4.0 Tf 52 523.7 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 516.2 Td (Durable lifecycle acknowledgment must follow complete atomic publication and required fsync) Tj ET
BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 502.8 Td (  steps. If publication or recovery is ambiguous, fail closed.) Tj ET
