BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 417.3 Td (  launch consumption, and lifecycle generation where applicable. Cross-identity evidence reuse) Tj ET
BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 404.0 Td (  is forbidden. Same-identity recovery may reuse evidence only when every required binding) Tj ET
BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 390.7 Td (  still matches.) Tj ET
