BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 110.2 Td (  select a compatible reporting/runtime version. An older harness may read supported legacy) Tj ET
BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 96.9 Td (  aggregates but cannot launch, accept plans, resume, or complete verification-v2 lifecycle) Tj ET
BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 83.5 Td (  state. If drainage or lifecycle state is uncertain, keep the worktree/runtime quarantined) Tj ET
BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 70.2 Td (  and require trusted recovery; never delete authority records to force rollback.) Tj ET
